          },
          "ios": {
            "value": "rgb(255,255,255)",
            "ref": "iOS 26.2 Settings > Accessibility > Motion, switch thumb, measured on simulator, light"
          },
          "basis": "ios",
          "why": "The thumb was the brand's primary foreground in both states, so a brand with a dark foreground drew a black thumb even when off. The switch follows iOS, whose thumb is white in every state and theme."
